<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP WIDENS TO 398 BPS, DOWN VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP WIDENS TO 398 BPS, DOWN VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds edged up to 398 basis points on Thursday from Wednesday's 397.</p>
<p>But the Greek/BTP gap shrank to 297 basis points from 301 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.65%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.67%	398	397 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.60%	405	405 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.68%	297	301 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.38%	327	329 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.35%	330	332 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.18%	247	247 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.43%	322	316 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0900 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
